MODULE: SagaScopedToCapturedPartitionsWaitsAllPartitions
TARGET: SagaScopedToCapturedPartitions
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: saga waits on saturation outside its captured routing snapshot
PERTURBS: SagaQuiesce
BOUNDS: AcuteOnly = FALSE

--- FIND
    /\ saga' = [saga EXCEPT !.status = IF SagaValue = 2 THEN "waiting" ELSE "ready",
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: discard captured partition scope.
    /\ saga' = [saga EXCEPT !.status = IF treeVerdict[1] = 2 THEN "waiting" ELSE "ready",
--- END
